    "detailed_description": "Hellbreachers is a retro styled action-platformer, the main feature of which is hero selection system with further choice of hero\u2019s specialization.<br>Choose between 3 characters: the Knight, the Magician and the assassin.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/926464ff789d54cacfa9b7f8d8a4b547.poster.avif?t=1671712714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/926464ff789d54cacfa9b7f8d8a4b547.webm?t=1671712714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/926464ff789d54cacfa9b7f8d8a4b547.mp4?t=1671712714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Each specialization has its own unique characteristics, ranged weapons and super-abilities!<br>Switch between different specializations anytime and find the one you will like the most!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/d1fdafb71b048b407ddb2119d7154f07.poster.avif?t=1671712714\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/d1fdafb71b048b407ddb2119d7154f07.webm?t=1671712714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1364330/extras/d1fdafb71b048b407ddb2119d7154f07.mp4?t=1671712714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Take a trip through 50 levels, 10 various locations and defeat 10 hardcore bosses!",
